5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I am worried the ground will surprise us. Who is actually digging here?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,I care about the cost after the ribbon is cut. What does the ledger say?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I want to see what the last decade of schemes looks like now.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,Who is left to run this place? The rota is shrinking.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,The park is crossed and drained weekly. We must respect the ground.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, the ledger is important, but I need to know who can dig.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, digging is a one-time cost. Upkeep is forever.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Victoria, the rota is short, but I worry about the quality of the work.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shizue, quality matters, but if no one is there to mow, it fails.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@All, we are ignoring the daily reality of the site.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will check the firms tendering for earth-moving.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,I will look at the upkeep ledger spend per hectare.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will review the condition of works from the earlier programme.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will examine the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will check the drainage callouts and August heat readings.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I will also look at the depot phasing notes on hoarding the site.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,I will also check the terms of the regional habitat fund.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will also review the record of the eastern avenue planting.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
