35,2,1,talk,Minato,,"Only two firms can dig, and they fear the clay. The south can be hoarded, but the center cannot.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,"The habitat fund pays for plants, not paving. Planted ground costs triple to maintain.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The old basin is fine, but the civic hall apron is patched thrice. The avenue trees died.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"We have seven staff, not eighteen. Volunteers handle weekends, but water care is bought in.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Storms double the callouts. Heat is higher here. People cross on hard ground, not soft margins.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, if the fund only pays for planting, we can't afford the plaza.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, exactly. The plaza is a financial trap. The woodland is funded.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Victoria, the volunteers are great, but they can't fix drainage or mow turf.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shizue, I agree. We need a plan that doesn't require heavy turf care.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@All, the data says avoid soft margins. People want hard, open ground.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minato,,The clay risk makes deep excavation dangerous. We must avoid heavy earth-moving.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,"The wetland is expensive to maintain. The woodland is cheaper, but still triple the cost.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The sports terraces need hard surfaces. The civic hall apron failed. Will this hold?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Victoria,,The sports terraces need constant mowing and cleaning. We don't have the staff.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The wetland fights the drainage issues. The plaza fights the heat and crossing patterns.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minato,,I think the woodland is the safest for the ground.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,May,,I think the woodland is the only one the fund covers.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"I am worried about the trees dying again, but the basin worked.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"I am worried about the maintenance, but the volunteers might help with habitat.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I am worried about the heat, but the trees might cool it down.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
