60,3,1,talk,Minato,,"The candidates are A: Woodland Walk, B: Market Plaza, C: Sports Terraces, D: Wetland Restoration.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,May,,A is funded. B and C are not. D is expensive.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shizue,,A risks tree death. C risks surface failure. D risks drainage.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Victoria,,A has volunteer support. C needs staff. D needs specialist care.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,A cools the site. B and C increase heat. D worsens drainage.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, A is the only one that fits the fund and the ground.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, agreed. A is the only financially viable option.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Victoria, A has the best chance of lasting, if we fix the aftercare.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shizue, I agree. The volunteers can help with the habitat tasks.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@All, A is the only one that respects the crossing patterns and heat.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Minato,,"I vote for A. The ground is safe, and the fund covers it.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,May,,I vote for A. It is the only one that doesn't bankrupt us.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"I vote for A. It is the most likely to endure, with proper care.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"I vote for A. The volunteers can support it, and it needs less staff.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I vote for A. It cools the site and respects the user flow.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Minato,,We are unanimous. A is the choice.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,May,,Agreed. Let's proceed with A.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I am glad we chose the enduring path.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Victoria,,I am confident in this choice.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,The data supports A. Let's move forward.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
